From 953ba86ac0a1da7eb98f401c8a113cb1ca7a225e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dennis Klappe <dennisklappe@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 10:52:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Remove the free/unsupported edition badges from the web app

Drops the 'TEAM EDITION' / 'ENTRY EDITION' badges and the 'This is the free
unsupported edition of Mattermost.' main menu notice:

  components/widgets/menu/menu_items/menu_start_trial.tsx  renders nothing
  .../product_menu/.../product_branding_free_edition.tsx   logo without badge
  components/header_footer_route/header.tsx                logo without badge

Also drops the now-obsolete tests and the orphaned en.json strings, and
renders nothing for the edition footer in the product switcher.
---
 .../product_branding_free_edition.tsx         | 18 +---
 .../switch_product_edition_menuitem.tsx       | 82 +---------------
 .../components/header_footer_route/header.tsx |  7 +-
 .../menu/menu_items/menu_start_trial.tsx      | 95 ++-----------------
 webapp/channels/src/i18n/en.json              | 16 ----
 5 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 204 deletions(-)

